        "Rework: fixed visionStatus() bug where it referenced repo.vision (undefined in RepoListItem) causing all repos to show 'No vision'. Applied Option A from QA bounce: (1) added has_full_vision: boolean to RepoListItem interface and toListItem() in gui/api-repos.ts — true when all three horizons are non-null; (2) rewrote visionStatus() in views/strategy.js to use repo.has_vision and repo.has_full_vision booleans directly; (3) updated tests/gui/api-repos.test.ts: added has_full_vision assertion to the AC-1 shape test, and two new tests covering has_full_vision true (all horizons non-null) and false (partial). All 3060 tests pass (2 new tests added)."
