          "type": "improvement",
          "priority": "low",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-05T10:00:07Z",
          "note": "No edge cases found in the rework scope. The only previously-noted edge case (nav link not highlighted on sub-routes) is still present but confirmed as consistent SPA behavior — not a bug for this WP."
