      "from_agent": "Developer",
      "to_agent": "QA",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-05T09:58:16Z",
      "notes": [
        "Rework complete. AC-1 is now fixed: visionStatus() uses has_vision and has_full_vision booleans from RepoListItem instead of the missing repo.vision object. Backend (api-repos.ts) now returns has_full_vision in the list response. All 3060 tests pass. QA should re-verify AC-1: repos with no vision show 'No vision' badge, repos with partial vision show 'Partial vision', repos with all three horizons filled show 'Full vision'."
